{"language_code":"spa","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Pero ahora viene el giro y es la segunda carta, el diez de bastos. Una persona caminando encorvada, cargando con diez palos tan pesados que ni siquiera puede ver hacia dónde va. Y aquí está la clave de tu lectura. Precisamente porque eres de fiar, has ido cogiendo cada vez más carga. Lo tuyo, lo de los demás, lo que nadie quiere hacer. Y has llegado a un punto en el que llevas demasiado. Esta carta no te reprocha nada, al contrario, reconoce todo tu esfuerzo, pero te pide que mires el montón de palos que llevas y te preguntes cuáles son de verdad tuyos. Delegar no es fallar. Pedir ayuda no es ser débil","words":[{"text":"Pero","start":0.06,"end":0.24,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00007199982064776123},{"text":" ","start":0.24,"end":0.28,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00001549708758830093},{"text":"ahora","start":0.3,"end":0.5,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00001549708758830093},{"text":" ","start":0.5,"end":0.56,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.5497195136049413e-6},{"text":"viene","start":0.56,"end":0.74,"type":"word","logprob":-1.5497195136049413e-6},{"text":" ","start":0.74,"end":0.76,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"el","start":0.76,"end":0.84,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":0.84,"end":0.94,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000012516897186287679},{"text":"giro","start":0.94,"end":1.22,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000012516897186287679},{"text":" ","start":1.22,"end":1.62,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.31507226824760437},{"text":"y","start":1.62,"end":1.68,"type":"word","logprob":-0.31507226824760437},{"text":" ","start":1.68,"end":1.74,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.576278118089249e-7},{"text":"es","start":1.74,"end":1.82,"type":"word","logprob":-3.576278118089249e-7},{"text":" ","start":1.82,"end":1.86,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"la","start":1.86,"end":1.92,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.92,"end":1.98,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000010013530300057027},{"text":"segu